{{!
    @template tool_vae/message_body

    The body in HTML of a message of the plugin: the sentence, then the link to the dossier, each in a paragraph. On one
    line: the message carries it as it comes.

    Every text comes from the context, given by tool_vae\output\message_body in the language of the recipient. The
    template holds no logic. Every value is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * body - string, the sentence
    * url - string, the address of the dossier
    * linkname - string, the words of the link

    Example context (json):
    {
        "body": "Your declaration against RNCP36832-C03 has been attested.",
        "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=5",
        "linkname": "Open the dossier"
    }
}}
<p>{{body}}</p><p><a href="{{url}}">{{linkname}}</a></p>
